<div class="page-wrap"><div class="eyebrow">THE COMMAND REFERENCE</div><div class="page-heading"><h1>命令速查</h1><p>收录 <%= learning().commands.length %> 条命令。可以按命令名、用途或选项搜索，每条结果都链接到相关的配置文件。</p></div><label class="search-field command-search"><%- icon('search') %><input id="command-query" type="search" aria-label="搜索命令" placeholder="输入命令或用途，例如 checkMesh、网格、并行…"><kbd>/</kbd></label><div class="filter-tabs" role="group" aria-label="命令分类"><% ['全部','系统工具','前处理','求解与并行','后处理','环境与编译','Linux'].forEach((c,i)=>{ %><button data-command-filter="<%= c %>" class="<%= i===0?'selected':'' %>" aria-pressed="<%= i===0 %>"><%= c %></button><% }); %></div><p class="result-count" id="command-count" aria-live="polite"></p><div id="command-list" class="command-grid"></div><noscript><p>搜索需要 JavaScript；也可以直接阅读<a href="/reference/">参考手册</a>。</p></noscript></div>
